abstract: >-
  Source code, explicit case definitions, and verification controls for ten
  conditional spectral exclusions in the search for a 14-variable Boolean
  function of real degree at most five and full sensitivity at the origin.
  The global existence question remains open. The work uses exact finite
  computation and written arguments, with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance;
  formal verification and human peer review are not claimed.
